Files and directory of distibution:

README		this text
LICENSE		GPL or MIT or etc license text
COMPILE		instructions how to build binaries including historical notes
VERSION		version of distibution
WISHES		ideas of future enhancements
PLAN		fixes plan (not in order)
BUGS		fixes required

MK-srpm.sh, DEBIAN, DEBIAN.sh	- scripts to build packages

configure	script for configuring compiling
conf/		cpecs and configuration variants
Makefile	main makefile

bin/		scripts to be installed with binaries
etc/		samples of terminal configs from vhset
lib/		help pages sources
misc/		miscellaneous staff
rc/		rc files and profiles
vash/		vash sources
vash.1		manual sources
vhset/		vhset utility sources
vhset.1		vhset manual
visi/		embedded VISI project with obsoleted manuals in russian
vtest/		test program for debug VISI itself

